      "raw": "[quote=\"\"broccoli\"\"]\n\nSorry if these have already been asked:\nI assume that because it has hp, Decoy Projection counts as a \"hero target\"?  I just wanted to verify, since this would usually mean that things that target \"the hero target with the lowest hp\" would directly target it, and things that deal damage \"to each hero target\" would essentially damage it twice (once directly, and once via redirect) right?\n\n[/quote]\n\n\nI think not, actually. It's a hero card and it's a target but I don't think it's actually a hero and thus it is not a hero target, it would not have the lowest hp, and would not be hit twice if something dealt damage \"to each hero target\".",
